+Implement flat chunking with `chunks_exact_mut` and safe array conversion/`as_chunks_mut`, zipped in a fixed named order; check remainders before use. No unsafe shape casts, pointer reconstitution or truncating `zip`. `ObsBuffersMut` is the literal flat counterpart of the row struct, including length-one scalar slices; spell all fields out in code, not a dynamic string map. `ObsStaging` has the same named fields as owned Vecs and an immutable n_envs. `publish` is only called with matching admitted n_envs and copies every field; debug assertion supplements the constructor invariant.
